    √ an escape that is not banked fails (1 ms)
    √ a banked escape that is now caught fails, so the improvement must be banked (1 ms)
    √ a banked entry whose fixture was deleted fails, so the list cannot be gamed
    √ a banked entry with no written reason fails (1 ms)
    √ the banked state is clean
    √ the committed baseline only names fixtures that exist, and every entry explains itself (14 ms)
  frozen-corpus identity
    √ the digest is path-sensitive: the same bytes under a different name is a different artifact (1 ms)
    √ the digest is order-insensitive (1 ms)
    √ a manifest diff separates missing, extra and mutated (1 ms)
    √ a fetched path that could escape the artifact directory is refused, not normalized (2 ms)
    √ every declared runtime maps to a dynamic-only ecosystem token (2 ms)
  disagreement — our verdict vs an existing conclusion
    √ verdicts project onto conclusions, and PROMPT is a suspicion rather than a clearance
    √ the outcome table (1 ms)
    √ the two reference sources are bucketed separately and never summed (32 ms)
    √ agreement is unmeasured when nothing is comparable, not 0% and not 100%
    √ an unreadable intel entry becomes unknown rather than being read as a clearance (164 ms)

